- {{Subchondral insufficiency fracture of the femoral head (SIFFH)}}
- {{Osteonecrosis / AVN of the femoral head}}
- {{ Rapidly destructive hip disease}}

Stress fracture in the femoral head can be due to:
- Increased load - so it is a **fatigue fracture**
- Normal load - Insufficiency fracture{{ (like our case today)}}
